{"id": "EUVD-2026-42570", "enisaUuid": "4380120f-e0bf-3229-88df-2f1589d449d9", "description": "A stack buffer overflow vulnerability was found in GStreamer's DTLS plugin. During a DTLS handshake, the peer certificate Subject Distinguished Name is printed into a fixed-size 2048-byte stack buffer without bounds checking. A remote unauthenticated attacker can send a certificate with an oversized Subject DN that exceeds the buffer, causing a stack buffer overflow and process crash, resulting in denial of service.", "datePublished": "2026-07-09T09:35:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-10T14:43:22", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:47179", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:47180", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:47731", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:54658", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:54659", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:54660", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:54664", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:54665", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:54752", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:56658", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:56772", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-59692", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2497344", "https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer-security/-/merge_requests/99", "https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/gstreamer/gstreamer/-/work_items/5172"], "aliases": ["GHSA-f48p-mg4r-fhww", "CVE-2026-59692"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.58, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "055b6d15-f3ba-359f-bc7b-f2f6540ef27b", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 9.2 Update Services for SAP Solutions", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0:1.18.4-9.el9_2.5"}, {"id": "15c717eb-b5a1-387c-a4ad-ff5848ee47c0", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8.6 Extended Update Su